    "title": "Pura",
    "description": "Get the best scenting experience possible with Pura\u2019s smart fragrance diffusers for your home and car. Paired with our smart diffuser and premium smart scents, the Pura app allows you to control, customize and personalize your fragrance experience\u2014all from your phone.\r\n\r\nSimply plug in your diffuser, set it up in the app, and let high-end, clean fragrance enhance every space and mood. The Pura app allows you to control scent intensity, diffusion time with custom schedules and timers, ambient light colors, and has an optional away mode.",
